Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 18:03:07+0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add setup guide links to WinUI manager status pages

Link unavailable managers to the matching upstream setup guide section, while keeping Classic's existing status and installer controls.

Upstream-Commit: 391d71f70e28ad1606adeca2711466b0a7da8df3
Upstream-PR: Devolutions/UniGetUI#5669

